									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >《崇祯直聘》于 2026 年 9 月 30 日开启 Steam 抢先体验（Early Access）。抢先体验版包含完整的<strong>地方线</strong>与<strong>边务线</strong>，开发期间将陆续加入新的剧情线、历史事件、玩法系统和结局，直至正式版（1.0）。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >一款以明末崇祯朝为背景的历史叙事策略游戏。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >大厦将倾，局势交迫。没有两全其美的坦途，只有步步惊心的权衡。在末世洪流里，你该如何保全自身，又将走向何方？</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>◆ 崇祯元年，你的故事开始</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >新帝登极，天下人都觉得日子要好起来了。你顾不上这些，眼前还有自己的难处。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >开封祥符的穷书生，苦读十年考中进士，一纸委状被扔到中原一座烂县，上任头一天就发现县库见了底。宣府卫所的百户之后，长兄战殁辽东，父亲告老，祖传的腰牌落到你手里，留给你的只有一座旧宅、几副锈甲。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >出身不同，路也全然不同。头顶的天却是一样的：旱了又涝，涝了又蝗，辽饷繁重，流民日增，外敌虎视眈眈。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/0806edc886eb12fb771d5cc5258c9456.poster.avif?t=1793848367" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/0806edc886eb12fb771d5cc5258c9456.webm?t=1793848367" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/0806edc886eb12fb771d5cc5258c9456.mp4?t=1793848367" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>◆ 地方线：治一座城，撑一片天</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >府库的银子永远不够用。农桑、商贸、百工、文教、城防样样要钱，粮饷要催，灾民要赈，你只能拆东墙补西墙，让这座城勉强运转下去。公堂上也不消停：佃户抗租、投毒灭门、漕粮被劫，依律严判还是收银默许，判词落下便覆水难收。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >内使催饷一拨接一拨，一封密告就能招来锦衣卫。你可以两袖清风，靠政绩熬过三年一次的考成；也可以把贪墨的私银塞给内使，换一顶更大的乌纱帽；被人密告下狱，甚至可以导演一场流民攻城，把三千团练拉上城头，让锦衣卫掉头回京。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/4680bdb6f9c7d6760e03a3c37e167fb4.poster.avif?t=1793848367" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/4680bdb6f9c7d6760e03a3c37e167fb4.webm?t=1793848367" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/4680bdb6f9c7d6760e03a3c37e167fb4.mp4?t=1793848367" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>◆ 边务线：一块百户腰牌，十七年南征北战</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >从宣府卫所的一个破落百户起步，手握一副锈甲、一块祖传腰牌，十余处边防要地随年月辗转推移。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >在防区沙盘上，你执掌一地防务。派夜不收哨探、屯田垦荒、调配兵马、设法筹粮。朝廷的粮饷常常半路克扣，营中嗷嗷待哺；公私之间如何权衡、加派还是自筹，每一步都牵动着军心与民情。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >临阵对敌，你亲手调度战阵。车营结阵、鸟铳列射、马队迂回包抄。兵马部曲是你立足的根基，战阵无情，打光了精锐，转眼便成弃子；即便惨胜，往往也只是换来一道新的催战急令。然而最险恶的往往不在阵前。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >督抚与中官各有算盘，兵部公文步步紧逼，身边的各路将帅也各怀心思。卢象升、孙传庭、曹文诏、左良玉……有人与你同袍共渡，也有人冷眼坐视。如何在各方猜忌中保全本部，考验远甚于战场交锋。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >而在塞外与中原的烽火背后，还有宣府老宅的一纸家书。操持生计的姐姐、痴迷火器的弟弟、奔走钻营的三叔……几封随商队辗转的信笺，记着乱世里一家人的冷暖悲欢。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >大厦将倾，四方云扰。当崇祯朝的天下走向终局，你带出来的这支百战之师，将带你走向怎样的末路或生途？</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/a66b581b88cb99ddee8a52fdecefa865.poster.avif?t=1793848367" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/a66b581b88cb99ddee8a52fdecefa865.webm?t=1793848367" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/a66b581b88cb99ddee8a52fdecefa865.mp4?t=1793848367" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>◆ 核心特色</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>处境交迫的艰难权衡</strong>：不设教条评判，没有阵营。无论是做清廉自守的循吏、八面玲珑的能臣，还是自保图存的枭雄，每一步取舍都连着真切的利益、人情与不可逆的代价。</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>两种出身，两种活法</strong>：寒门文官经营一座城池，军户武官带兵辗转九边。更多出身将陆续开放。</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>治城与断案</strong>：三十余种政务决策，形形色色的公堂案件，每一桩都牵扯利益与人情。</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>沙盘与即时战斗</strong>：十三卷防区沙盘，筹粮、屯田、布阵、临阵指挥。</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>真实历史</strong>：从崇祯元年到十七年，天灾、兵祸、党争、民变逐年推进，史实人物的命运也可能因你改变。</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>数十种结局</strong>：殉节、南渡、降清、坚守、称霸、客死，甚至走上万人之巅。没有标准的最优解，只有你一路走来的抉择汇聚而成的命运。</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/e51f63cbee556fcd7431929accacf930.poster.avif?t=1793848367" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/e51f63cbee556fcd7431929accacf930.webm?t=1793848367" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/e51f63cbee556fcd7431929accacf930.mp4?t=1793848367" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>◆ 这天下，还救得了吗？</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >十七年。从崇祯元年到甲申之变，够你回答一个问题了。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >序幕已经拉开，大人，该你登场了。</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras/119cb4f50f024ce21f90eeda7a421001.avif?t=1793848367" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4942770/extras_big/119cb4f50f024ce21f90eeda7a421001.avif?t=1793848367 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p>						</div>
					</div>
