			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					During development, AI tools were used to assist in polishing select text descriptions, as well as providing technical support for some of the character art and music assets.<br />
<br />
However, the core narrative, setting, and gameplay systems are 100% original, conceived and designed entirely by our team. We wanted to share this with complete transparency and genuinely thank you for your understanding and support. We welcome you to enjoy the game based on your own preferences!				</i>
			</p>
